[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3568364003","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113085#issuecomment-3568364003","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113085","id":3568364003,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7UsOnj","user":{"login":"arkology","id":43543909,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNTQzOTA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43543909?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology","html_url":"https://github.com/arkology","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-23T21:43:07Z","updated_at":"2025-11-23T21:44:47Z","body":"I can suggest the following: Make current editor setting property something like default script sorting for new projects (or deprecate it completely). Expose script sorting selection as you did, with additional button in script list, but with all sorting options, not only recently edited. And store current sort selection in project setting.\r\nI can miss something because ATM it's 0:45 a.m...","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3568364003/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3568372030","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113085#issuecomment-3568372030","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113085","id":3568372030,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7UsQk-","user":{"login":"vaner-org","id":9658355,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk2NTgzNTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9658355?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org","html_url":"https://github.com/vaner-org","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-23T21:54:04Z","updated_at":"2025-11-23T22:15:02Z","body":"> I can suggest the following: Make current editor setting property something like default script sorting for new projects (or deprecate it completely). Expose script sorting selection as you did, with additional button in script list, but with all sorting options, not only recently edited. And store current sort selection in project setting.\r\n\r\nThank you for your suggestion, I'd like to offer a counterpoint. The current options of none vs name vs path are quite particular, and if the user is explicitly choosing to select one, one would imagine they have a definite preference when it comes to the organisation of their sidebar... whereas the \"most recently opened\" state this PR offers another thing entirely: the ability to quickly isolate a handful of scripts/docs to focus on, or take organisation out of the picture entirely by tying reordering to something objective.\r\n\r\nIn my workflow at least, this would function best as a temporary toggle versus the specific stylistic preference laid out by the editorsetting, and adding a dropdown to go back to \"name\" or \"path\" would likely introduce friction by presenting a choice I'm sure most users aren't even aware of.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3568372030/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3949337610","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113085#issuecomment-3949337610","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113085","id":3949337610,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7rZhwK","user":{"login":"vaner-org","id":9658355,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk2NTgzNTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9658355?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org","html_url":"https://github.com/vaner-org","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/received_events","type":"User","user_v